        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-12T01:50:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you don't have trash shenanigans from Visionary or Chrono-ranger, Raiding Parties are the only way to reliably get rid of the ship.&nbsp; You just have to hope both All Together Nows get discarded.&nbsp; Once they're both in the trash with the ship, you're pretty much set... if you can clean up the crew members.</p>",
