        "id": 87650,
        "name": "Odin",
        "username": "Odin",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/odin/{size}/2572_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-15T02:21:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The first time I played La Capitan with my brother (we don't play anything but advanced) we got mauled but the more we play her which, admittedly, is a ton the easier she gets. Kill the ship. Peck at her with small attacks when she flips then unleash when she flips back. The only crew that we have trouble with is that stupid samurai (sorry if it is modeled after someone) and trueshot. I love playing her though; I enjoy having a spanish villain to pronounce with a true spanish accent. Although the French from Le Epistiete (sorry about spelling don't have my cards with me) is rough on natural spanish speakers....</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
